VMApple restore support for the pinned macOS/HVF QEMU tree

Base: 1b41f5f5db4d1067d023973b9bd74c7b341e0d28
Ported from this project's QEMU patches 0001, 0002, 0003 and 0007,
originally by Lakr, with original co-authorship retained in those patches.
The scratch RAM is mapped after the Reims GPU takes its memory map.
This is a local experimental integration, not an upstream submission.
The changes retain the QEMU sources' GPL-2.0-or-later licence.

